# Runtime cache written by SlateHUDHelper.exe / ScanGames.ps1 (regenerated automatically)
@Resources/Cache/

# Compiled binaries & third-party plugins (built via @Resources/build.ps1 or distributed in Releases)
@Resources/SlateHUDHelper.exe
@Resources/Plugins/SlateHUD.dll
@Resources/Plugins/FrostBehind.dll
@Resources/Plugins/FrostedGlass.dll

# Old helper and native build artifacts
*.exe.bak
*.dll.bak
*.obj
*.lib
*.exp
*.pdb
*.rmskin
dist/
@Resources/.tmp-plugin-*/
@Resources/SlateHUDHelper.review-*.exe

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/
.vs/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.tmp
*.TMP

# Personal notes and active-tab state (created/updated by the Notes skin; defaults live in Notes/Defaults.inc)
Notes/Data/
Notes/Settings.inc

# Personal Game Hub favorites
Games/Favorites.txt
Games/Favorites.txt.bak
Games/GameList.inc
Games/GameList.inc.bak
Games/View.inc
Games/Recent.txt
Games/Recent.txt.bak
Games/Preferences.txt
Games/Preferences.txt.bak

# Generated app launcher catalog and saved expanded group
Apps/Catalog.inc
Apps/Catalog.inc.bak
Apps/View.inc
Apps/Preferences.txt
Apps/Preferences.txt.bak

# Shared user overrides (created at runtime by menu toggles / settings; keeps Variables.inc clean)
@Resources/UserSettings.inc

# Isolated regression-test output (also cleaned by the test runner)
Tests/.scratch-*/
